   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. \"Sign in with Google\" on /login/\n2. allauth redirects the browser to Google\n3. Google → /accounts/google/login/callback/\n   (always https in production)\n4. Django swaps the code for the profile\n   server-side and reads the email\n5. Allow-list: the email must have an\n   Enrollment row (or be staff)\n6. Session cookie (DB sessions) → signed in\n7. OAuth tokens are not stored\n   (SOCIALACCOUNT_STORE_TOKENS = False)",
   "originalText": "1. \"Sign in with Google\" on /login/\n2. allauth redirects the browser to Google\n3. Google → /accounts/google/login/callback/\n   (always https in production)\n4. Django swaps the code for the profile\n   server-side and reads the email\n5. Allow-list: the email must have an\n   Enrollment row (or be staff)\n6. Session cookie (DB sessions) → signed in\n7. OAuth tokens are not stored\n   (SOCIALACCOUNT_STORE_TOKENS = False)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
