   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Write course_content/<course>/sessions/NN-*.md\n   (+ video block, diagrams, code/, practice yaml)\n2. git push → GitHub Actions: tests + build every\n   course + check practice files\n3. Action SSHes in as deploy → deploy.sh: git pull;\n   code changed? rebuild containers\n4. First time only: create the Course row\n   (admin or manage.py shell)\n5. deploy_content: build changed courses\n   (Sphinx + MyST + Shibuya) + load_practice\n6. Output → docs_build/<slug>/html\n   (old build serves until the new one is ready)\n7. Enrol students: admin → Add users (bulk)",
   "originalText": "1. Write course_content/<course>/sessions/NN-*.md\n   (+ video block, diagrams, code/, practice yaml)\n2. git push → GitHub Actions: tests + build every\n   course + check practice files\n3. Action SSHes in as deploy → deploy.sh: git pull;\n   code changed? rebuild containers\n4. First time only: create the Course row\n   (admin or manage.py shell)\n5. deploy_content: build changed courses\n   (Sphinx + MyST + Shibuya) + load_practice\n6. Output → docs_build/<slug>/html\n   (old build serves until the new one is ready)\n7. Enrol students: admin → Add users (bulk)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
