   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. practice/*.yaml → load_practice → Quiz,\n   Question, Deck, Flashcard rows\n   (matched by title; renamed_from keeps scores)\n2. quiz.js → GET /courses/<slug>/quizzes.json\n   → cards for this chapter's quizzes + decks\n3. Take a quiz → POST with CSRF token →\n   graded on the server → Attempt row\n4. Flashcards: Got it / Again → POST review\n   → CardReview row\n5. Staff: scoreboard + CSV export\n   (formula-injection safe)\nOnly enrolled students + staff (can_track)",
   "originalText": "1. practice/*.yaml → load_practice → Quiz,\n   Question, Deck, Flashcard rows\n   (matched by title; renamed_from keeps scores)\n2. quiz.js → GET /courses/<slug>/quizzes.json\n   → cards for this chapter's quizzes + decks\n3. Take a quiz → POST with CSRF token →\n   graded on the server → Attempt row\n4. Flashcards: Got it / Again → POST review\n   → CardReview row\n5. Staff: scoreboard + CSV export\n   (formula-injection safe)\nOnly enrolled students + staff (can_track)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
