   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. progress.js → GET /courses/<slug>/progress.json\n2. \"Mark as complete\" → POST\n   /courses/<slug>/progress/ (CSRF, rate-limited)\n3. Saved as PageProgress (user, course, page)\n4. Dashboard: % done per course +\n   completed hint on each page\n5. Not enrolled → no button, nothing stored\n   (can_track = staff or enrolled in that course)\n6. APIs: 401 JSON when signed out,\n   Cache-Control: no-store",
   "originalText": "1. progress.js → GET /courses/<slug>/progress.json\n2. \"Mark as complete\" → POST\n   /courses/<slug>/progress/ (CSRF, rate-limited)\n3. Saved as PageProgress (user, course, page)\n4. Dashboard: % done per course +\n   completed hint on each page\n5. Not enrolled → no button, nothing stored\n   (can_track = staff or enrolled in that course)\n6. APIs: 401 JSON when signed out,\n   Cache-Control: no-store",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
