   "text": "⑥ Blog from the Obsidian vault",
   "originalText": "⑥ Blog from the Obsidian vault",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el119",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 674,
   "y": 1615.0,
   "width": 425.12000000000006,
   "height": 240.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 562571391,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 91898035,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Write in Obsidian → push second-brain\n   (PUBLIC repo: only blog notes!)\n2. GitHub Action (on push) → ssh sync-blog →\n   sync_blog.sh → git pull (cron: 6 h fallback)\n3. import_blog --prune: frontmatter (PyYAML)\n   → markdown-it → wikilinks resolved →\n   nh3 sanitise (only YouTube iframes,\n   → youtube-nocookie) → Post rows\n4. Images / PDFs → PostAsset, served at\n   /blog/media/<path> only if a post uses them\n5. /blog/ · /blog/<slug>/ · feed.xml · sitemap\n6. Works without WordPress (files in the vault)",
   "originalText": "1. Write in Obsidian → push second-brain\n   (PUBLIC repo: only blog notes!)\n2. GitHub Action (on push) → ssh sync-blog →\n   sync_blog.sh → git pull (cron: 6 h fallback)\n3. import_blog --prune: frontmatter (PyYAML)\n   → markdown-it → wikilinks resolved →\n   nh3 sanitise (only YouTube iframes,\n   → youtube-nocookie) → Post rows\n4. Images / PDFs → PostAsset, served at\n   /blog/media/<path> only if a post uses them\n5. /blog/ · /blog/<slug>/ · feed.xml · sitemap\n6. Works without WordPress (files in the vault)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
