   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Anonymous visitor\n   ✔ common courses, blog   ✘ enrolled courses\n\nStudent enrolled in course A\n   ✔ A + common courses\n   ✔ progress, quizzes, flashcards in A\n   ✘ other enrolled-only courses\n\nStaff\n   ✔ everything + /admin/, draft quizzes,\n   scoreboards, rebuild docs\n\nUnknown Google account → sign-in refused",
   "originalText": "Anonymous visitor\n   ✔ common courses, blog   ✘ enrolled courses\n\nStudent enrolled in course A\n   ✔ A + common courses\n   ✔ progress, quizzes, flashcards in A\n   ✘ other enrolled-only courses\n\nStaff\n   ✔ everything + /admin/, draft quizzes,\n   scoreboards, rebuild docs\n\nUnknown Google account → sign-in refused",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
