   "text": "courses\n   Course (slug, source_dir, is_common, build_status)\n   Enrollment (course, email)\n   PageProgress (user, course, page)\nquizzes\n   Quiz → Question · Attempt (user, score, answers)\n   Deck → Flashcard · CardReview (user, card, known)\nblog\n   Post · Tag · PostAsset\nauth / allauth\n   User · SocialAccount (Google) · Session\n\nNot in git → back up with pg_dump",
   "originalText": "courses\n   Course (slug, source_dir, is_common, build_status)\n   Enrollment (course, email)\n   PageProgress (user, course, page)\nquizzes\n   Quiz → Question · Attempt (user, score, answers)\n   Deck → Flashcard · CardReview (user, card, known)\nblog\n   Post · Tag · PostAsset\nauth / allauth\n   User · SocialAccount (Google) · Session\n\nNot in git → back up with pg_dump",
