   "text": "🛡 Security controls",
   "originalText": "🛡 Security controls",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el128",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 54,
   "y": 1975.0,
   "width": 864.1600000000001,
   "height": 160.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1519490801,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1967786446,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• HTTPS only (Let's Encrypt on the host proxy); secure cookies in production\n• Google-only sign-in with an e-mail allow-list; no passwords stored\n• Docs are never public files: Django checks access → X-Accel-Redirect → internal nginx location\n• CSRF on every POST · require_safe / require_POST · JSON APIs answer 401, not redirects\n• nginx POST rate limit 5 r/s per real client IP (proxy IPs trusted only from private ranges)\n• Blog HTML sanitised with nh3; quiz Markdown renders with raw HTML disabled\n• Cache-Control: no-store on personal data · CSV formula-injection guard\n• Secrets only in .env · the vault repo is public, so private notes stay out of it",
   "originalText": "• HTTPS only (Let's Encrypt on the host proxy); secure cookies in production\n• Google-only sign-in with an e-mail allow-list; no passwords stored\n• Docs are never public files: Django checks access → X-Accel-Redirect → internal nginx location\n• CSRF on every POST · require_safe / require_POST · JSON APIs answer 401, not redirects\n• nginx POST rate limit 5 r/s per real client IP (proxy IPs trusted only from private ranges)\n• Blog HTML sanitised with nh3; quiz Markdown renders with raw HTML disabled\n• Cache-Control: no-store on personal data · CSV formula-injection guard\n• Secrets only in .env · the vault repo is public, so private notes stay out of it",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
