  },
  {
   "id": "el131",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1294,
   "y": 1975.0,
   "width": 998.5600000000001,
   "height": 160.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1890322093,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 786442398,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• Push to main → GitHub Actions (tests, docs build) → SSH as 'deploy' → forced command deploy/ci.sh → deploy.sh\n• The deploy key can only run: deploy · build-docs · load-practice · sync-blog · backup · status\n  (Actions → Server tasks for manual runs); the blog key can only run sync-blog\n• nginx re-resolves web through Docker DNS → no lasting 502 after the web container restarts\n• cron: blog sync every 6 h (fallback) · backup_db.sh 02:30 (14 days) · clearsessions 03:00 ·\n  docker image prune Sundays 04:00\n• DB rows (courses, enrolments, scores) are not in git: copy backups/ off the VPS too\n• Restore: gunzip -c backups/portal-DATE.sql.gz | docker compose exec -T db psql -U portal portal",
   "originalText": "• Push to main → GitHub Actions (tests, docs build) → SSH as 'deploy' → forced command deploy/ci.sh → deploy.sh\n• The deploy key can only run: deploy · build-docs · load-practice · sync-blog · backup · status\n  (Actions → Server tasks for manual runs); the blog key can only run sync-blog\n• nginx re-resolves web through Docker DNS → no lasting 502 after the web container restarts\n• cron: blog sync every 6 h (fallback) · backup_db.sh 02:30 (14 days) · clearsessions 03:00 ·\n  docker image prune Sundays 04:00\n• DB rows (courses, enrolments, scores) are not in git: copy backups/ off the VPS too\n• Restore: gunzip -c backups/portal-DATE.sql.gz | docker compose exec -T db psql -U portal portal",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  }
 ],
